 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Linear with respect to the number of input rays and the average number of voxels traversed per ray [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Linear with respect to the number of voxels and rays [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
+*   **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
 *   **Measured Performance:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Strengths:** Efficient handling of sparse voxel data; MIS reduces variance in lighting estimates [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Limitations:** Requires sparse voxel data structure; MIS weight calculation can be complex [S1, unofficial].
-*   **When to use:** When rendering scenes with sparse voxel data and requiring efficient lighting estimation [S1, unofficial].
-*   **When not to use:** When dense voxel data is used, or when MIS overhead is not justified [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Strengths:** Efficiently handles sparse voxel data and uses MIS between sun disk and cosine-weighted hemisphere sampling to reduce variance in lighting estimates [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Limitations:** Requires a sparse voxel data structure and a palette-based albedo lookup [S1, unofficial].
+*   **When to use:** Rendering scenes with sparse voxel data where efficient lighting estimation is needed [S1, unofficial].
+*   **When not to use:** Scenes with dense voxel data or when MIS overhead is not justified [S1, unofficial].
 
